  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "資料結構與演算法",
    "sub_ename": "DATA STRUCTURES AND ALGORITHMICS",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將學習資料結構與演算法的理論與應用，藉由探討資料的不同表示方式與優缺點，學習如何設計好的資料結構及演算法，進而設計出高效率的程式，以提升程式設計和解決問題的能力。課程內容包含簡介資料結構的種類與功能特色、介紹資料結構的基本原理與應用、及介紹演算法原理說明與實際應用。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will learn the theory and application of data structure and algorithm. By exploring the different representations and advantages and disadvantages of data, learning how to setup data structure and algorithm with highly efficient programs to improve problem solving skills. The course includes an introduction to the characteristics of data structures, the basic principles and applications of data structures, and algorithm principles with practical applications.",
